{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_016KjkEz1GrgLxduWFPs6Mnp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have everything I need. Let me mark Item 3 as IN_PROGRESS and then create the files:\n\n1. `src/main/resources/schema.sql` - PostgreSQL-compatible DDL\n2. `src/test/resources/schema.sql` - H2-compatible DDL (BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT instead of BIGSERIAL)\n3. `src/test/resources/application-test.properties` - H2 MODE=PostgreSQL config\n4. `src/main/resources/data.sql` - seed data (mentioned in spec)\n5. `src/main/resources/application.properties` - PostgreSQL defaults (mentioned in spec, also used by Item 4)\n\n\nI need to verify H2 compatibility for the schema constraints—BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT, DECIMAL(19,2), CHECK clauses, DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, and UNIQUE constraints all work fine in H2, so I just need to configure the test properties with the H2 JDBC URL and PostgreSQL mode.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3754,"cache_read_input_tokens":44932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3754},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59730fe8-333f-4ee5-9582-185174253ca8","uuid":"e3214bcc-e996-4644-9c93-8717d4d98272"}
